# The Checklist Manifesto - Atul Gawande

Atul Gawande's work arguing that checklists improve performance in medicine, aviation, and other fields. The book presents evidence that surgical checklists reduce complications and deaths.

## Relationship to Atul Gawande
Gawande is a surgeon and author already documented in the wiki through [[atul-gawande]] and [[being-mortal]]. The Checklist Manifesto extends his exploration of how simple systems can address complex problems in healthcare.

## Connection to Mental Models
This work connects to the [[checklists]] mental model and to broader frameworks like [[recipes-mental-model]] and [[planning]].